# Stack

This is a read-only Microsoft Fabric Data App teaching demo.

- React 19 + Vite 7 + TypeScript 5.7 + Tailwind 4
- Visuals: `@microsoft/fabric-visuals` Vega-Lite + `@microsoft/fabric-datagrid`
- Data: live DAX via `@microsoft/fabric-app-data` against a semantic model over Demo DW
- Setup: `docs/GETTING_STARTED.md`

Prefer small, reviewable diffs. Do not add catalog, admin, or Power BI embed.

Before marking any change complete, follow `.cursor/rules/change-completion.mdc` (docs in `docs/`, tests, thermo-nuclear review).
